  "details": "When I try building a world for Android for the first time, and then running it on my phone, I usually find that it's much too dark.   It took me a while to realise that it was because \"pixel light count\" defaults to \"off\" on Android!   I couldn't find anything about this in the docs -- it could be a good warning to mention somewhere in the world creation FAQs!   (In particular, I'd love to know if that's the same on Quest, or specific to Android phones/tablets?)",
